  m_text: "Alto del Tel\xE9grafo is a hill located in Spain, its name suggesting
    a historical connection to telegraph communications. Like many elevated points
    in Spain, it likely offers panoramic views of the surrounding landscape, with
    the undulating terrain, olive groves, and distant mountain ranges characteristic
    of the Spanish countryside."
